assertion_line: 55
expression: env.render_long_help().to_string()
---
Create, inspect, switch, rename, or remove AIRS environments

Usage: airs env [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create  Create an environment and sign in; supply --gateway-url for automation
  list    List environments; an asterisk marks the default for new processes
  use     Select the default environment for new processes
  show    Inspect a named or selected environment without showing credentials
  status  Show the gateway and local credential availability for an environment
  rename  Rename an environment while preserving its credentials and history
  remove  Unregister an environment, preserving its local history on disk
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help

With no action, lists saved environments.
Start with: airs env create work
For automation: airs env create work --gateway-url URL
